  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water. • Cook spaghetti in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 9 minutes. • Reserve pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain spaghetti.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b4b511ee4a266ae24c/step-0cf33200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, pick thyme leaves. • In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. • Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. • Reduce heat to medium and stir in tomato sugo, red wine jus, thyme leaves, the salt and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b4b511ee4a266ae24c/step-dca67610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove pan from heat and stir in baby spinach leaves and cooked spaghetti, until wilted and combined. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b4b511ee4a266ae24c/step-653b8120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide cheat&#39;s plant-based mince ragu and red wine spaghetti between bowls. Top with Parmesan cheese. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b4b511ee4a266ae24c/step-14337530.jpg"
    }
  ]
